      "statement": "The final stage re-declares ARG RTA_COMMIT to set the image's org.opencontainers.image.revision OCI label, and its offline verify_sre_tools.py runtime check also validates the shipped rta binary: static ELF, correct architecture, no setuid/writable bits, absence of any Go toolchain/module cache/Trusted Actions source on disk, and that `rta version -o json` reports the expected version, linux/<arch> platform, a commit matching RTA_COMMIT, and a non-empty build date.",
